Mappop
======

Mappop is an independent derivative of Simple mind map, maintained upstream at:
https://github.com/wanglin2/mind-map

Upstream baseline: e8e5ef9c41bc13ca7b13084e078123adff002242
Upstream copyright: Copyright (c) 2021-2023 The MindMap Team
Upstream license: MIT. The original full license is retained in LICENSE.

The Git history preserves upstream authorship. Mappop adds its own branding,
English first-run experience, original visual themes and textures, map API,
deployment configuration, tests, and documentation. Mappop is not an official
release of the upstream project and does not imply upstream endorsement.

