Artwork and closed products
---------------------------
The Mappop wordmark, favicon, README banner, and Mappop theme textures are
original assets created for this project and are distributed under the
repository MIT license. They do not reproduce upstream desktop-client art.
Upstream separately distributes closed-source desktop clients and plugins.
Those products are not part of Mappop and are not granted an MIT license by
this repository. Commercial product screenshots and promotional materials
are not used as Mappop theme or interface assets.
